    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly it feels like whenever people try to be \"neutral\" or talk about \"both sides\" they're just helping the establishment hide the truth. like with the great awakening... how can anyone even try to be balanced when the media is literally just lying to protect the people in power? isnt being \"neutral\" just a way to stay silent while the movement is out there actually unmasking everything?",
